n they are young. Since the lion is rough and eats the cow, it must be young. And since it's young, it's big. So yes, the lion is big.\n\nI don't see any other rules that would contradict this. So the statement \"The lion is big\" is true.\n</think>\n\nThe lion is big.\n\n**Answer:** A) True",
