92 Round). From the first point, round things are kind, so Fiona is kind (Round \u2192 Kind). Therefore, Fiona is both big and round, which makes her kind.\n\nWait, but the question is whether Fiona is not kind. If Fiona is kind, then the statement \"Fiona is not kind\" would be false. But according to the given information, Fiona is big, which makes her round and hence kind. So, the statement is false.\n\nBut let me double-check to make sure I didn't miss anything. The given information doesn't mention Fiona being not kind, so based on the provided data, Fiona is kind. Therefore, the statement is false.\n</think>\n\nThe statement \"Fiona is not kind\" is false because Fiona is big, which makes her round and hence kind.\n\n**Answer: B) False**",
